# Execution Plan: Twitch EventSub Full Integration
## Sprint 16 (sprint-16-aalwmj)

**Lead Implementor**: Claude Code
**Created**: 2026-08-16
**Status**: Ready for Execution
**Related**: `technical-architecture.md`

---

## Executive Summary

This execution plan breaks down the Twitch EventSub Full Integration project into actionable tasks organized by milestones. The plan follows an incremental delivery approach, ensuring each milestone delivers testable, deployable value while minimizing risk.

**Total Estimated Duration**: 5-6 weeks (25-30 working days)
**Critical Path**: Foundation → Subscription Manager → Event Builders → Testing
**Risk Level**: Medium (mitigated by incremental delivery and feature flags)

---

## Milestones Overview

| Milestone | Duration | Dependencies | Deliverables | Risk |
|-----------|----------|--------------|--------------|------|
| **M1: Foundation** | 3-4 days | None | YAML config, schema, config loader, registry | Low |
| **M2: Core Infrastructure** | 4-5 days | M1 | Subscription manager, refactored client | Medium |
| **M3: Tier 1 Events** | 5-6 days | M2 | 13 high-value event builders | Low |
| **M4: Tier 2 Events** | 3-4 days | M3 | 5 moderation event builders | Low |
| **M5: Observability** | 2-3 days | M2 | MCP tools, metrics, health checks | Low |
| **M6: Testing & Validation** | 4-5 days | M3, M4 | Unit tests, integration tests, load tests | Medium |
| **M7: Documentation** | 2-3 days | M6 | User guides, migration guide, references | Low |
| **M8: Deployment** | 3-4 days | M6, M7 | Staged rollout, monitoring, completion | Medium |

**Total**: 26-34 days

---

## Milestone 1: Foundation (Days 1-4)

**Goal**: Establish YAML configuration system and registry infrastructure

### Success Criteria
- [x] YAML config file created with 20+ events defined
- [x] JSON schema validates config structure
- [x] Config loader successfully loads and caches configuration
- [x] Builder registry initialized with 4 existing builders
- [x] All unit tests passing (>80% coverage)

### Tasks (12 tasks)

#### 1.1 Configuration Structure
- **Task**: Create YAML subscription config file
- **File**: `config/platforms/twitch/eventsub-subscriptions.yaml`
- **Effort**: 2 hours
- **Description**: Define initial subscription config with all 4 existing events plus Tier 1 events (20+ total)
- **Acceptance Criteria**:
  - File contains version, subscriptions, and channelOverrides sections
  - All 4 existing events defined (channel.follow, channel.update, stream.online, stream.offline)
  - Tier 1 events defined but disabled by default (13 events)
  - Includes builder names, internal types, scopes, priorities

#### 1.2 JSON Schema
- **Task**: Create JSON schema for validation
- **File**: `config/schemas/eventsub-subscriptions.v1.yaml`
- **Effort**: 1 hour
- **Description**: Define JSON Schema for subscription config validation
- **Acceptance Criteria**:
  - Schema validates version (must be 1)
  - Schema validates required fields (enabled, builder, internalType)
  - Schema validates optional fields (scope, priority, version, mutation)
  - Schema validates channelOverrides structure

#### 1.3 Config Loader Implementation
- **Task**: Implement SubscriptionConfigLoader class
- **File**: `src/services/ingress/twitch/subscription-config-loader.ts`
- **Effort**: 4 hours
- **Description**: Load and validate YAML config with caching
- **Acceptance Criteria**:
  - Loads YAML from configurable path
  - Validates against schema
  - Caches loaded config
  - Falls back to default config if file not found
  - Provides reload() method to clear cache
  - Handles YAML parse errors gracefully

#### 1.4 Config Loader Tests
- **Task**: Unit tests for SubscriptionConfigLoader
- **File**: `src/services/ingress/twitch/__tests__/subscription-config-loader.spec.ts`
- **Effort**: 2 hours
- **Description**: Comprehensive tests for config loading
- **Acceptance Criteria**:
  - Test valid YAML loading
  - Test invalid YAML error handling
  - Test missing file fallback to defaults
  - Test config caching
  - Test reload functionality
  - Test schema validation (invalid version, missing fields)
  - >85% code coverage

#### 1.5 Builder Registry Implementation
- **Task**: Implement EventBuilderRegistry class
- **File**: `src/services/ingress/twitch/event-builder-registry.ts`
- **Effort**: 3 hours
- **Description**: Registry for EventSub event builders
- **Acceptance Criteria**:
  - Registers all 4 existing builders in constructor
  - Provides get(name) method (returns null if not found)
  - Provides has(name) method
  - Provides list() method
  - Handles duplicate registration (logs warning)
  - Fail-open strategy (returns null instead of throwing)

#### 1.6 Builder Registry Tests
- **Task**: Unit tests for EventBuilderRegistry
- **File**: `src/services/ingress/twitch/__tests__/event-builder-registry.spec.ts`
- **Effort**: 2 hours
- **Description**: Tests for builder registration and lookup
- **Acceptance Criteria**:
  - Test builder registration
  - Test builder lookup (found and not found)
  - Test has() method
  - Test list() method
  - Test duplicate registration warning
  - >85% code coverage

#### 1.7 Directory Structure
- **Task**: Create config directory structure
- **Files**:
  - `config/platforms/twitch/` (exists)
  - `config/schemas/` (create if needed)
- **Effort**: 15 minutes
- **Description**: Ensure directory structure exists
- **Acceptance Criteria**:
  - Directories created
  - .gitkeep files if empty

#### 1.8 Package Dependencies
- **Task**: Verify NPM dependencies
- **File**: `package.json`
- **Effort**: 30 minutes
- **Description**: Ensure all required dependencies installed
- **Acceptance Criteria**:
  - `js-yaml` installed (for YAML parsing)
  - `@types/js-yaml` installed (TypeScript types)
  - All Twurple packages at correct versions (^7.4.0)

#### 1.9 Type Definitions
- **Task**: Create TypeScript interfaces
- **File**: `src/services/ingress/twitch/subscription-config-loader.ts`
- **Effort**: 1 hour
- **Description**: Define SubscriptionConfig and EventSubscriptionConfig interfaces
- **Acceptance Criteria**:
  - SubscriptionConfig interface exported
  - EventSubscriptionConfig interface exported
  - Mutation config interface defined
  - All fields properly typed

#### 1.10 Integration Smoke Test
- **Task**: Basic integration test
- **File**: `src/services/ingress/twitch/__tests__/config-integration.spec.ts`
- **Effort**: 1 hour
- **Description**: End-to-end test loading config and initializing registry
- **Acceptance Criteria**:
  - Loads config from fixture file
  - Initializes registry
  - Verifies all 4 existing builders present
  - Validates config structure

#### 1.11 Documentation - Config Format
- **Task**: Document YAML config format
- **File**: `planning/sprint-16-aalwmj/config-format-reference.md`
- **Effort**: 1 hour
- **Description**: Reference guide for subscription config format
- **Acceptance Criteria**:
  - Explains all top-level fields
  - Explains subscription config fields
  - Provides examples for common scenarios
  - Documents channelOverrides feature

#### 1.12 Milestone Review
- **Task**: Code review and validation
- **Effort**: 1 hour
- **Description**: Review all M1 deliverables
- **Acceptance Criteria**:
  - All tests passing
  - Code review completed
  - Coverage >80%
  - Documentation complete

**Milestone 1 Total Effort**: ~19 hours (~2.5 days)

