## Milestone 2: Core Infrastructure (Days 5-9)

**Goal**: Implement subscription manager and refactor EventSub client

### Success Criteria
- [x] SubscriptionManager class implemented
- [x] TwitchEventSubClient refactored to use SubscriptionManager
- [x] All 4 existing events still working (backward compatibility)
- [x] Scope validation working
- [x] Subscription status tracking working
- [x] Feature flag implementation complete
- [x] All unit tests passing

### Tasks (15 tasks)

#### 2.1 Subscription Manager - Core Implementation
- **Task**: Implement SubscriptionManager class skeleton
- **File**: `src/services/ingress/twitch/subscription-manager.ts`
- **Effort**: 3 hours
- **Description**: Core class structure with constructor
- **Acceptance Criteria**:
  - Constructor accepts listener, apiClient, publisher, mutationPublisher
  - Initializes EventBuilderRegistry
  - Initializes SubscriptionConfigLoader
  - Initializes subscription status map
  - Provides subscribeChannel() method signature
  - Provides getStatus() method
  - Provides unsubscribeAll() method

#### 2.2 Subscription Manager - Event Type Mapping
- **Task**: Implement getListenerMethod()
- **File**: `src/services/ingress/twitch/subscription-manager.ts`
- **Effort**: 2 hours
- **Description**: Map EventSub types to Twurple listener methods
- **Acceptance Criteria**:
  - Mapping for all 4 existing events
  - Mapping for Tier 1 events (13 events)
  - Returns null if method not found
  - Validates method exists on listener
  - Logs warning if method not found

#### 2.3 Subscription Manager - Scope Validation
- **Task**: Implement validateScope()
- **File**: `src/services/ingress/twitch/subscription-manager.ts`
- **Effort**: 2 hours
- **Description**: OAuth scope validation before subscription
- **Acceptance Criteria**:
  - Uses apiClient.tokenInfo to get scopes
  - Checks if required scope present
  - Returns boolean (true/false)
  - Handles API errors gracefully (returns false)
  - Logs validation results

#### 2.4 Subscription Manager - Subscription Logic
- **Task**: Implement subscribe() method
- **File**: `src/services/ingress/twitch/subscription-manager.ts`
- **Effort**: 4 hours
- **Description**: Core subscription creation logic
- **Acceptance Criteria**:
  - Gets builder from registry
  - Gets listener method from mapping
  - Calls listener method with event handler
  - Event handler builds InternalEventV2
  - Event handler publishes to message bus
  - Event handler publishes mutation (if configured)
  - Tracks subscription in status map
  - Updates metrics (event count, error count)
  - Handles errors gracefully (logs, continues)

#### 2.5 Subscription Manager - Channel Subscription
- **Task**: Implement subscribeChannel() method
- **File**: `src/services/ingress/twitch/subscription-manager.ts`
- **Effort**: 3 hours
- **Description**: Subscribe to all enabled events for a channel
- **Acceptance Criteria**:
  - Loads subscription config
  - Applies channel overrides
  - Iterates over enabled subscriptions
  - Validates builder exists
  - Validates scope (if required)
  - Calls subscribe() for each enabled event
  - Logs summary (total subscriptions, skipped)

#### 2.6 Subscription Manager - Metrics
- **Task**: Implement updateMetrics() method
- **File**: `src/services/ingress/twitch/subscription-manager.ts`
- **Effort**: 1 hour
- **Description**: Track subscription health metrics
- **Acceptance Criteria**:
  - Increments event count
  - Increments error count
  - Updates lastEventAt timestamp
  - Updates lastErrorAt timestamp
  - Updates subscription status (active/error)

#### 2.7 Subscription Manager - Status API
- **Task**: Implement getStatus() method
- **File**: `src/services/ingress/twitch/subscription-manager.ts`
- **Effort**: 1 hour
- **Description**: Return subscription status for monitoring
- **Acceptance Criteria**:
  - Returns array of SubscriptionStatus
  - Includes channel, eventType, status, counts, timestamps
  - Used by getSnapshot() in TwitchEventSubClient

#### 2.8 Subscription Manager Tests
- **Task**: Unit tests for SubscriptionManager
- **File**: `src/services/ingress/twitch/__tests__/subscription-manager.spec.ts`
- **Effort**: 4 hours
- **Description**: Comprehensive tests for subscription manager
- **Acceptance Criteria**:
  - Test subscribeChannel() flow
  - Test scope validation (valid/invalid)
  - Test builder lookup (found/not found)
  - Test listener method mapping
  - Test metrics updates
  - Test getStatus() API
  - Test unsubscribeAll()
  - >85% code coverage

#### 2.9 Refactor TwitchEventSubClient - Feature Flag
- **Task**: Add feature flag support
- **File**: `src/services/ingress/twitch/eventsub-client.ts`
- **Effort**: 1 hour
- **Description**: Add ENABLE_EVENTSUB_YAML_CONFIG feature flag
- **Acceptance Criteria**:
  - Check env var in start() method
  - Branch: useYamlConfig = true → new path
  - Branch: useYamlConfig = false → legacy path
  - Default: false (backward compatibility)

#### 2.10 Refactor TwitchEventSubClient - New Path
- **Task**: Implement YAML-driven subscription path
- **File**: `src/services/ingress/twitch/eventsub-client.ts`
- **Effort**: 3 hours
- **Description**: Integrate SubscriptionManager into client
- **Acceptance Criteria**:
  - Initialize SubscriptionManager in start()
  - Pass listener, apiClient, publisher, mutationPublisher
  - Call subscribeChannel() for each channel
  - Remove hardcoded subscription logic (when flag enabled)
  - Update getSnapshot() to include subscription details

#### 2.11 Refactor TwitchEventSubClient - Legacy Path
- **Task**: Extract hardcoded subscriptions to method
- **File**: `src/services/ingress/twitch/eventsub-client.ts`
- **Effort**: 2 hours
- **Description**: Isolate legacy subscription logic
- **Acceptance Criteria**:
  - Extract lines 111-259 to subscribeHardcoded() method
  - Called when feature flag = false
  - No behavior changes
  - Maintains backward compatibility

#### 2.12 Refactor Tests - Update Existing
- **Task**: Update TwitchEventSubClient tests
- **File**: `src/services/ingress/twitch/__tests__/eventsub-client.spec.ts`
- **Effort**: 2 hours
- **Description**: Update tests for refactored client
- **Acceptance Criteria**:
  - Tests pass with feature flag = false (legacy)
  - Tests pass with feature flag = true (new path)
  - Add tests for feature flag branching
  - Maintain existing test coverage

#### 2.13 Integration Test - End-to-End
- **Task**: Integration test for new subscription flow
- **File**: `src/services/ingress/twitch/__tests__/subscription-integration.spec.ts`
- **Effort**: 3 hours
- **Description**: Test full flow from config to subscription
- **Acceptance Criteria**:
  - Loads config from fixture
  - Initializes SubscriptionManager
  - Subscribes to test channel
  - Verifies subscriptions created
  - Simulates event, verifies InternalEventV2 published
  - Verifies mutation published

#### 2.14 Environment Variable Documentation
- **Task**: Document ENABLE_EVENTSUB_YAML_CONFIG
- **File**: `documentation/reference/environment-variables.md`
- **Effort**: 30 minutes
- **Description**: Add feature flag to environment variables reference
- **Acceptance Criteria**:
  - Documents flag name, type, default, purpose
  - Explains migration path

#### 2.15 Milestone Review
- **Task**: Code review and validation
- **Effort**: 2 hours
- **Description**: Review all M2 deliverables
- **Acceptance Criteria**:
  - All tests passing (unit + integration)
  - Feature flag works correctly
  - Legacy path unchanged
  - New path functional
  - Coverage >80%

**Milestone 2 Total Effort**: ~33 hours (~4 days)

